{"2981740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shogun Castle", "steam_appid": 2981740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>U.S. Army Tanks vs Japanese Castles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shogun Castle</i> is a tank game set during a hypothetical World War II invasion of mainland Japan. Players take control of Allied tanks and attempt to capture Japanese castles defended by enemy tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a total of 44 Japanese castles, each carefully recreated in 3D based on historical research. As you enjoy the beauty of these castles from the Sengoku period, you will battle and destroy enemy tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the trailer and free demo, the stage is set at Kumamoto Castle in Kyushu.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>U.S. Army Tanks vs Japanese Castles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shogun Castle</i> is a tank game set during a hypothetical World War II invasion of mainland Japan. Players take control of Allied tanks and attempt to capture Japanese castles defended by enemy tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a total of 44 Japanese castles, each carefully recreated in 3D based on historical research. As you enjoy the beauty of these castles from the Sengoku period, you will battle and destroy enemy tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the trailer and free demo, the stage is set at Kumamoto Castle in Kyushu.</p>", "short_description": "Shogun Castle is a tank game set during a hypothetical World War II invasion of mainland Japan. Players take control of Allied tanks and attempt to capture Japanese castles defended by enemy tanks.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Indonesian, Ukrainian, Dutch, Greek, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Czech, Danish, Turkish, Norwegian, Hungarian, Finnish, Bulgarian, Vietn